<title>JAPAN: Foreign investment in Japan markets in Feb - JSDA.</title>
<headline>Foreign investment in Japan markets in Feb - JSDA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment by non-residents in Japanese capital markets for February, region by region and in billions of yen, were as follows, the Japan Securities Dealers Association (JSDA) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>	   INVESTMENT IN YEN BONDS</p>
<p>	  US/Canada Europe   Asia     Others   Total</p>
<p> February +219.6   +863.9   +453.7   +140.8   +1,678.0</p>
<p> January +262.7   +744.5   +764.95  +71.5    +1,843.7</p>
<p>	   INVESTMENT IN JAPANESE STOCKS</p>
<p> February+224.6   +178.7   +22.6    +3.2     +429.1</p>
<p> January -22.2    +61.4    -105.5   -2.7     -68.99</p>
</text>
